{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame magical creatures called Decklings and lead them into challenging battles in this survival deck-building card game. Explore wild biomes, gather resources, and craft to build your base as you shape your path to become the Deckling Champion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/e8fcf8051fa1f8ccf9b80c9d8e3f6395.avif?t=1767834541\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique islands with diverse biomes, resources, and unique Decklings to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame wild Decklings to grow your collection, featuring over 100 unique creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Deckling has unique abilities and move sets that can be learned as they level up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your Decklings to learn new moves or upgrade existing ones to enhance their decks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728Hunt rare holo Decklings scattered across different biomes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/224a7723716d94d51463d79489d89817.poster.avif?t=1767834541\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/224a7723716d94d51463d79489d89817.webm?t=1767834541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/224a7723716d94d51463d79489d89817.mp4?t=1767834541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/1e35f42811d33a5a940459b48fc7609b.avif?t=1767834541\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle other tamers in 3x3 card duels on your path to becoming the Deckling Champion!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different team combinations and explore their synergies to defeat your foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat other guilds and collect their flags as you rise through the ranks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your base against invasions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/cce5ead0a05b8f7c94daf54849bf15c7.poster.avif?t=1767834541\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/cce5ead0a05b8f7c94daf54849bf15c7.webm?t=1767834541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/cce5ead0a05b8f7c94daf54849bf15c7.mp4?t=1767834541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/b811e486e0e68675d0bf88b9fa6b0062.avif?t=1767834541\" width=616 height=156 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack cards to craft all sorts of items, including food, equipment, and stations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn new recipes as you progress on your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft equipment and items to get special bonuses and buffs in battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook delicious meals to feed your Decklings to keep the team together, or they might run away</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate your production building plantation fields, logging sites, feeders, and much more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/07c54c17bfebdcc7af449d89d78d5644.poster.avif?t=1767834541\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/07c54c17bfebdcc7af449d89d78d5644.webm?t=1767834541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/extras/07c54c17bfebdcc7af449d89d78d5644.mp4?t=1767834541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3715790?t=1767834541","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3715790?t=1767834541","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/a7149bf200a64dfd60d29bdca1f9f0b936903ccf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767834541","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715790/a7149bf200a64dfd60d29bdca1f9f0b936903ccf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767834541","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame magical creatures called Decklings and lead them into challenging battles in this survival deck-building card game. Explore wild biomes, gather resources, and craft to build your base as you shape your path to become the Deckling Champion.</p>